{
  "_comment": "Эталон расчётов услуг-слотов «Домов» (ARCHITECTURE_CYCLE39.md §39.3–§39.8, §39.11; API_CONTRACT_CYCLE39.md §39.38). ОДИН файл читают юнит-тесты бэкенда (ServiceBooking.UnitTests: ServiceVectorsTests, ArrivalReminderTemplateTests) и vitest фронта dom (dom/src/utils/businessClock.test.ts, serviceTimeFormat.test.ts, serviceMoney.test.ts, serviceWindows.test.ts). Раздел reminderTemplate — только бэкенд (рендер напоминания есть только на сервере). Пояс — Asia/Novokuznetsk (UTC+7, без перехода на летнее время). Время суток услуги — минуты от 00:00 даты бизнес-дня; граница бизнес-дня B = 360 (06:00). 2027-01-15 — пятница, 2026-12-31 — четверг. Деньги — целые рубли. Правка правила = правка векторов в том же коммите.",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "common": { "timeZoneId": "Asia/Novokuznetsk", "businessDayStartMinute": 360 },

  "businessDay": {
    "_rule": "BusinessDateOf(tz, utc): local = utc в поясе; date = дата(local − B минут); minute = минуты от 00:00 даты date до local (B ≤ minute < B + 1440). ToUtc(tz, date, minute) — обратное. TodayBusinessDate = дата из BusinessDateOf(now).",
    "cases": [
      { "id": "BD01", "utc": "2027-01-15T15:00:00Z", "_local": "пт 15.01 22:00", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 1320 } },
      { "id": "BD02", "utc": "2027-01-15T17:30:00Z", "_local": "сб 16.01 00:30", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 1470 } },
      { "id": "BD03", "utc": "2027-01-15T22:59:00Z", "_local": "сб 16.01 05:59", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 1799 } },
      { "id": "BD04", "utc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z", "_local": "сб 16.01 06:00", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-16", "minute": 360 } },
      { "id": "BD05", "utc": "2026-12-31T16:00:00Z", "_local": "чт 31.12 23:00", "expected": { "businessDate": "2026-12-31", "minute": 1380 } },
      { "id": "BD06", "utc": "2026-12-31T18:00:00Z", "_local": "пт 01.01 01:00 — смена года", "expected": { "businessDate": "2026-12-31", "minute": 1500 } },
      { "id": "BD07", "utc": "2027-01-31T20:00:00Z", "_local": "пн 01.02 03:00 — смена месяца", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-31", "minute": 1620 } },
      { "id": "BD08", "utc": "2027-01-15T05:00:00Z", "_local": "пт 15.01 12:00", "expected": { "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 720 } }
    ],
    "toUtc": [
      { "id": "BU01", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 1500, "expectedUtc": "2027-01-15T18:00:00Z" },
      { "id": "BU02", "businessDate": "2027-01-16", "minute": 360, "expectedUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z" },
      { "id": "BU03", "businessDate": "2026-12-31", "minute": 1380, "expectedUtc": "2026-12-31T16:00:00Z" },
      { "id": "BU04", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "minute": 1800, "expectedUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z" }
    ]
  },

  "windows": {
    "_rule": "Окна одного дня: Start, End кратны 30; B ≤ Start < End ≤ B + 1440; не больше 3; не пересекаются (касание допустимо). Ошибка — первая по порядку: WindowNotOnGrid → WindowEmpty → WindowOutsideBusinessDay → TooManyWindows → WindowsOverlap.",
    "cases": [
      { "id": "W01", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 1080, "endMinute": 1560 } ], "expected": { "ok": true, "labels": [ "18:00 – 02:00 (след. дня)" ] } },
      { "id": "W02", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 1080, "endMinute": 1830 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "WindowOutsideBusinessDay" } },
      { "id": "W03", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 300, "endMinute": 600 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "WindowOutsideBusinessDay" } },
      { "id": "W04", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 960 }, { "startMinute": 900, "endMinute": 1200 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "WindowsOverlap" } },
      { "id": "W05", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 960 }, { "startMinute": 960, "endMinute": 1200 } ], "expected": { "ok": true, "labels": [ "12:00 – 16:00", "16:00 – 20:00" ] } },
      { "id": "W06", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 725, "endMinute": 960 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "WindowNotOnGrid" } },
      { "id": "W07", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 360, "endMinute": 480 }, { "startMinute": 540, "endMinute": 600 }, { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 780 }, { "startMinute": 900, "endMinute": 960 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "TooManyWindows" } },
      { "id": "W08", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 960, "endMinute": 960 } ], "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "WindowEmpty" } },
      { "id": "W09", "windows": [ { "startMinute": 360, "endMinute": 1800 } ], "expected": { "ok": true, "labels": [ "06:00 – 06:00 (след. дня)" ] } }
    ]
  },

  "priceRules": {
    "_rule": "Правило: daysMask (бит 0 = Пн … бит 6 = Вс, 1…127), fromHour < toHour, 6 ≤ fromHour, toHour ≤ 30, priceRub 1…100000. Новое правило пересекается с существующим, если (маски & ≠ 0) и [from, to) пересекаются. Ошибка — первая по порядку: NoDays → HoursOutOfRange → PriceOutOfRange → PriceRuleOverlap.",
    "existing": [ { "id": "R-FRI-EVE", "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 26, "priceRub": 2000 } ],
    "cases": [
      { "id": "PRV01", "rule": { "daysMask": 48, "fromHour": 24, "toHour": 28, "priceRub": 2500 }, "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "PriceRuleOverlap", "conflictingRuleId": "R-FRI-EVE" } },
      { "id": "PRV02", "rule": { "daysMask": 32, "fromHour": 24, "toHour": 28, "priceRub": 2500 }, "expected": { "ok": true } },
      { "id": "PRV03", "rule": { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 5, "toHour": 10, "priceRub": 1000 }, "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "HoursOutOfRange" } },
      { "id": "PRV04", "rule": { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 26, "toHour": 31, "priceRub": 1000 }, "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "HoursOutOfRange" } },
      { "id": "PRV05", "rule": { "daysMask": 0, "fromHour": 10, "toHour": 12, "priceRub": 1000 }, "expected": { "ok": false, "error": "NoDays" } },
      { "id": "PRV06", "rule": { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 12, "toHour": 18, "priceRub": 1500 }, "expected": { "ok": true, "_note": "касание с 18–26 допустимо" } }
    ],
    "labels": [
      { "id": "PL01", "rule": { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 26 }, "expectedGuest": "Пт 18:00 — 02:00 (ночь на сб)", "expectedStaff": "Пт 18:00 – 02:00 (след. дня)" },
      { "id": "PL02", "rule": { "daysMask": 31, "fromHour": 10, "toHour": 18 }, "expectedGuest": "Пн–Пт 10:00 — 18:00", "expectedStaff": "Пн–Пт 10:00 – 18:00" }
    ]
  },

  "price": {
    "_rule": "ServicePricing.HourPrices: час k начинается в минуту m = startMinute + 60k бизнес-дня старта; цена — правило с битом дня недели бизнес-дня и fromHour×60 ≤ m < toHour×60; нет правила → null (старт недоступен).",
    "ruleSets": {
      "FRI": [ { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 12, "toHour": 18, "priceRub": 1500 }, { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 26, "priceRub": 2000 } ],
      "FRI-TO-MIDNIGHT": [ { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 24, "priceRub": 2000 } ],
      "SAT": [ { "daysMask": 32, "fromHour": 10, "toHour": 24, "priceRub": 2500 } ],
      "THU-NIGHT": [ { "daysMask": 8, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 30, "priceRub": 3000 } ]
    },
    "cases": [
      { "id": "PR01", "ruleSet": "FRI", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "startMinute": 1380, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 2000, 2000 ], "_note": "пт 23:00–01:00 = 4 000 ₽ (Р39-16)" },
      { "id": "PR02", "ruleSet": "FRI", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "startMinute": 1470, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 2000, 2000 ], "_note": "пт 00:30 (ночь на сб) – 02:30 — по правилам пятницы" },
      { "id": "PR03", "ruleSet": "FRI", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "startMinute": 1530, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 2000, null ] },
      { "id": "PR04", "ruleSet": "FRI", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "startMinute": 1050, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 1500, 2000 ], "_note": "часы 17:30 и 18:30 — по правилам, содержащим их начало" },
      { "id": "PR05", "ruleSet": "FRI-TO-MIDNIGHT", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "startMinute": 1380, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 2000, null ], "_note": "у часа 00:00 нет цены — старт недоступен" },
      { "id": "PR06", "ruleSet": "SAT", "businessDate": "2027-01-16", "startMinute": 1380, "hours": 1, "expected": [ 2500 ] },
      { "id": "PR07", "ruleSet": "THU-NIGHT", "businessDate": "2026-12-31", "startMinute": 1380, "hours": 2, "expected": [ 3000, 3000 ], "_note": "31 дек 23:00 – 1 янв 01:00 относится к 31 декабря" }
    ]
  },

  "money": {
    "_rule": "service = Σ hourPrices; items = Σ quantity × unitPriceRub; total = service + items; prepay = prepayPercent == null ? 0 : floor((service × prepayPercent + 50) / 100) (позиции не входят); dueOnSite = total − prepay; firstHourRub = hourPrices[0].",
    "cases": [
      { "id": "MO01", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 2000, 2000 ], "items": [ { "unitPriceRub": 300, "quantity": 2 } ], "prepayPercent": 30 }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 4000, "itemsAmountRub": 600, "totalRub": 4600, "prepayRub": 1200, "dueOnSiteRub": 3400, "firstHourRub": 2000 } },
      { "id": "MO02", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 1500, 2000 ], "items": [], "prepayPercent": null }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 3500, "itemsAmountRub": 0, "totalRub": 3500, "prepayRub": 0, "dueOnSiteRub": 3500, "firstHourRub": 1500 } },
      { "id": "MO03", "_note": "половина — вверх: 1010 × 5 % = 50,5 → 51", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 1010 ], "items": [], "prepayPercent": 5 }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 1010, "itemsAmountRub": 0, "totalRub": 1010, "prepayRub": 51, "dueOnSiteRub": 959, "firstHourRub": 1010 } },
      { "id": "MO04", "_note": "3333 × 15 % = 499,95 → 500; бесплатная позиция", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 3333 ], "items": [ { "unitPriceRub": 0, "quantity": 3 } ], "prepayPercent": 15 }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 3333, "itemsAmountRub": 0, "totalRub": 3333, "prepayRub": 500, "dueOnSiteRub": 2833, "firstHourRub": 3333 } },
      { "id": "MO05", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 2000, 2000, 2000 ], "items": [ { "unitPriceRub": 150, "quantity": 1 } ], "prepayPercent": 100 }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 6000, "itemsAmountRub": 150, "totalRub": 6150, "prepayRub": 6000, "dueOnSiteRub": 150, "firstHourRub": 2000 } },
      { "id": "MO06", "_note": "позиции по умолчанию 0 (69-ФЗ) — строки позиций нет", "input": { "hourPrices": [ 2000, 2000 ], "items": [ { "unitPriceRub": 300, "quantity": 0 } ], "prepayPercent": 30 }, "expected": { "serviceAmountRub": 4000, "itemsAmountRub": 0, "totalRub": 4000, "prepayRub": 1200, "dueOnSiteRub": 2800, "firstHourRub": 2000 } }
    ]
  },

  "starts": {
    "_rule": "ServiceSlotCalculator.Calculate (ARCHITECTURE_CYCLE39.md §39.4.2). Для каждого окна, для s = окно.start + k × step, s < окно.end: maxHours = наибольшее h ≤ service.maxHours, при котором s + 60h ≤ окно.end, [sUtc, sUtc + h ч + buffer) не пересекает occupied, у каждого часа есть цена, [sUtc, sUtc + h) ⊂ stayRange (если задан), sUtc ≥ now + minLead. Старт попадает в список при maxHours ≥ minHours. Дата вне [today, today + horizonDays − 1] → пусто с reason. occupied — [startUtc, occupiedUntilUtc).",
    "_ruleSetNote": "В кейсе либо ruleSet (ссылка на price.ruleSets), либо rules (правила прямо в кейсе). windows: \"baseWindowsFri\" — ссылка на baseWindowsFri, иначе массив окон. service отсутствует — baseService. checks — проверки IsStartAllowed вместо полного списка.",
    "baseService": { "minHours": 2, "maxHours": 6, "stepMinutes": 60, "bufferMinutes": 30, "minLeadMinutes": 60 },
    "baseWindowsFri": [ { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 960 }, { "startMinute": 1080, "endMinute": 1560 } ],
    "cases": [
      { "id": "ST01", "_note": "пусто, всё свободно", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "ruleSet": "FRI", "windows": "baseWindowsFri", "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 720, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 780, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 840, "maxHours": 2 }, { "startMinute": 1080, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1140, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1200, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1260, "maxHours": 5 }, { "startMinute": 1320, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 1380, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 1440, "maxHours": 2 } ] } },
      { "id": "ST02", "_note": "занят пт 23:00–01:00 (+30 мин): зазор нового сеанса тоже не должен залезать", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "ruleSet": "FRI", "windows": "baseWindowsFri",
        "occupied": [ { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "occupiedUntilUtc": "2027-01-15T18:30:00Z" } ],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 720, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 780, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 840, "maxHours": 2 }, { "startMinute": 1080, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 1140, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 1200, "maxHours": 2 } ] } },
      { "id": "ST03", "_note": "проверка IsStartAllowed через полночь: шаг 30, окно 18:00–04:00, занят пт 23:00–01:00 (+30)", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365,
        "service": { "minHours": 2, "maxHours": 6, "stepMinutes": 30, "bufferMinutes": 30, "minLeadMinutes": 60 },
        "rules": [ { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 30, "priceRub": 2000 } ],
        "windows": [ { "startMinute": 1080, "endMinute": 1680 } ],
        "occupied": [ { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "occupiedUntilUtc": "2027-01-15T18:30:00Z" } ],
        "checks": [ { "startMinute": 1470, "hours": 2, "allowed": false }, { "startMinute": 1530, "hours": 2, "allowed": true }, { "startMinute": 1500, "hours": 2, "allowed": false } ] },
      { "id": "ST04", "_note": "зазор через границу бизнес-дня: пт 04:00–06:00 (+30) закрывает сб 06:00", "businessDate": "2027-01-16", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365,
        "rules": [ { "daysMask": 32, "fromHour": 6, "toHour": 12, "priceRub": 1000 } ],
        "windows": [ { "startMinute": 360, "endMinute": 600 } ],
        "occupied": [ { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T21:00:00Z", "occupiedUntilUtc": "2027-01-15T23:30:00Z" } ],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 420, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 480, "maxHours": 2 } ] } },
      { "id": "ST05", "_note": "минимальное время до начала 60 мин: сейчас пт 12:30", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-15T05:30:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "ruleSet": "FRI", "windows": "baseWindowsFri", "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 840, "maxHours": 2 }, { "startMinute": 1080, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1140, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1200, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1260, "maxHours": 5 }, { "startMinute": 1320, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 1380, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 1440, "maxHours": 2 } ] } },
      { "id": "ST06", "_note": "сеанс в брони: выезд пт 12:00 — в день выезда старта нет", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "ruleSet": "FRI", "windows": "baseWindowsFri", "occupied": [],
        "stayRange": { "fromUtc": "2027-01-14T07:00:00Z", "toUtc": "2027-01-15T05:00:00Z" },
        "expected": { "reason": "NoStarts", "starts": [] } },
      { "id": "ST07", "_note": "часы без цены: только Пт 18–24", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-14T00:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "ruleSet": "FRI-TO-MIDNIGHT", "windows": "baseWindowsFri", "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 1080, "maxHours": 6 }, { "startMinute": 1140, "maxHours": 5 }, { "startMinute": 1200, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 1260, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 1320, "maxHours": 2 } ] } },
      { "id": "ST08", "_note": "за горизонтом", "businessDate": "2027-02-14", "nowUtc": "2027-01-15T05:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 30, "rules": [ { "daysMask": 127, "fromHour": 6, "toHour": 30, "priceRub": 1000 } ], "windows": [ { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 960 } ], "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": "BeyondHorizon", "starts": [] } },
      { "id": "ST09", "_note": "прошедший бизнес-день", "businessDate": "2027-01-14", "nowUtc": "2027-01-15T05:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365, "rules": [ { "daysMask": 127, "fromHour": 6, "toHour": 30, "priceRub": 1000 } ], "windows": [ { "startMinute": 720, "endMinute": 960 } ], "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": "DateInPast", "starts": [] } },
      { "id": "ST10", "_note": "в 01:00 субботы «сегодня» для услуги — ещё пятница: старт пт 02:00 (минута 1560) доступен", "businessDate": "2027-01-15", "nowUtc": "2027-01-15T18:00:00Z", "horizonDays": 365,
        "service": { "minHours": 1, "maxHours": 6, "stepMinutes": 60, "bufferMinutes": 0, "minLeadMinutes": 60 },
        "rules": [ { "daysMask": 16, "fromHour": 18, "toHour": 30, "priceRub": 2000 } ], "windows": [ { "startMinute": 1080, "endMinute": 1800 } ], "occupied": [],
        "expected": { "reason": null, "starts": [ { "startMinute": 1560, "maxHours": 4 }, { "startMinute": 1620, "maxHours": 3 }, { "startMinute": 1680, "maxHours": 2 }, { "startMinute": 1740, "maxHours": 1 } ] } }
    ]
  },

  "overlap": {
    "_rule": "Семантика ограничения БД EX_StayServiceSessions_NoOverlap: два активных сеанса одной услуги конфликтуют, если [startUtc, endUtc + buffer) пересекаются (полуинтервалы). Полночь и граница бизнес-дня не участвуют.",
    "cases": [
      { "id": "OV01", "a": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T18:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "b": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T17:30:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T19:30:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "conflict": true, "_note": "пт 23:00–01:00 и пт 00:30 (ночь на сб)–02:30" },
      { "id": "OV02", "a": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T18:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "b": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T18:30:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T20:30:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "conflict": false, "_note": "касание после зазора" },
      { "id": "OV03", "a": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T21:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "b": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-16T01:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "conflict": true, "_note": "пт 04:00–06:00 + 30 мин и сб 06:00" },
      { "id": "OV04", "a": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T21:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 0 }, "b": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T23:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-16T01:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "conflict": false },
      { "id": "OV05", "a": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T18:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "b": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T14:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2027-01-15T16:00:00Z", "bufferMinutes": 30 }, "conflict": true, "_note": "зазор нового сеанса залезает на существующий" }
    ]
  },

  "refund": {
    "_rule": "ServiceRefund.Compute (ЮР39-1, LEGAL_REVIEW_CYCLE39.md §2.4). Конечный статус → NothingPaid. Held или prepay = 0 → NothingPaid. Отменяет компания → Full. NoDeductions → Full. PreparationCosts: момент < startUtc − boundaryHours → Full; иначе D = min(prepay, firstHourRub), X = prepay − D: X > 0 → PartialAtLeast (refundAtLeastRub = X, maxDeductionRub = D); X = 0 → CostsOnlyUpTo (refundAtLeastRub = null — «не меньше 0 ₽» не показывается никогда, maxDeductionRub = D). AwaitingPaymentCheck и Confirmed — оплачены.",
    "common": { "startUtc": "2027-01-15T15:00:00Z", "_note": "пт 15.01 22:00; рубеж 12 ч = 2027-01-15T03:00:00Z" },
    "cases": [
